# Local QingToolbox development environments
/.qingtoolbox/

# Qing Launcher redistributes a fixed, license-bundled Everything runtime.
# Keep generated module resources ignored while allowing the pinned source
# assets to be committed and reviewed.
!QingToolbox.Tauri/native-launcher/third-party/
!QingToolbox.Tauri/native-launcher/third-party/Everything/
!QingToolbox.Tauri/native-launcher/third-party/Everything/*.exe
!QingToolbox.Tauri/native-launcher/third-party/Everything/*.dll
